HOW TO ADD YOUR COUNTRY
-----------------------
1. Copy the block above into data/broadcasts.json, keyed by your ISO-3166 alpha-2
   country code (e.g. "GB", "BR", "IN") instead of "XX".
2. List FREE options FIRST: type "free-tv", then "free-stream", then "radio".
   Put any paid option ("paid-tv" / "paid-stream") AFTER all the free ones.
3. Every channel needs an official "source" URL — the broadcaster's OWN page.
   No aggregators, no blogs.
4. Language tags are ISO-639-1 ("en", "pt", "ar", ...).
5. NEVER add pirate / unlicensed "free stream" links. Official rights-holders
   only. Pirate links get the whole repo taken down — instant reject.
6. VERIFY the free/paid flag against the broadcaster before submitting. A wrong
   flag is the one thing that breaks trust in this feature.

NOTE: this file is a template — it intentionally does not parse as pure JSON
because of these instructions. Copy only the JSON object above into
broadcasts.json.
